<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia MISC 96 net down to 477 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia MISC 96 net down to 477 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    47.7	  vs	  56.3</p>
<p>    Net profit	    477.34	 vs	 561.70</p>
<p>    Turnover	    2,411.62	 vs     2,474.99</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	506.55	 vs	 585.0</p>
<p>    Minorities   less     2.52	 vs less    2.30</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)     18.0	  vs	  20.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysian International Shipping Corp Bhd is involved in shipping and transportation.</p>
</text>
